Z||000000||e_utopia||01-24-2001||04:23 AM||||Hi, new here, and I was wondering if you guys could provide me with some info.<P>Does anyone have accurate performance numbers (HP, torque, 0-60, lateral acceleration, weight, etc.) for each year (I only actually care about the V6 numbers, but if you have others, I'm not going to complain)?<P>--thanks,<BR>JB<P>------------------<BR>e_utopia@hotmail.com||||reg||5
Z||000001||Kelvin Vivian||01-24-2001||05:59 AM||||Here are the performance numbers gathered from the Witzenburg Fiero Book:<P>85 GT, 4-spd: 8.2-8.5 sec (0-60), .80-.82g,  2572 lbs<P>86 GT, 4-spd: 7.5-8.4 sec (0-60), .80-.81g, 2696 lbs<P>88 GT, 5-spd: 7.8-8.7 sec (0-60), .84g, <BR>2735 lbs<P>88 Formula, 5-spd: 7.9-8.0 sec (0-60), .83g, <BR>no weight given<P>84 SE, 4-spd, axle 4.10: 10.5-11.6 (0-60), .77-.84g, 2480 lbs||||reg||6
